    <string name="import_note">Choosing a folder recreates the same folder tree inside the app.\n\nWhatever sits under the clients folder is indexed: the outer folder becomes the client, the one inside it the case number.\n\nFolders kept by kind of paper — powers of attorney, identity cards — move across as they are, unless a file names one of your clients, in which case it is filed under that client, because it belongs to the person rather than to any one case.\n\nPages are kept as they are, with no re-cropping or re-enhancing.</string>
